  "Title": "ELSA-2026-100748:  nginx security update (CRITICAL)",
  "Description": "[1.20.1-32.0.2.el9_9.2]\n- Reference oracle-indexhtml within Requires [Orabug: 33802044]\n- Remove Red Hat references [Orabug: 29498217]\n- Update upstream references [Orabug: 36579090]\n\n[2:1.20.1-32.2]\n- Resolves: RHEL-309559 - nginx: NGINX ngx_http_v2_module\n  vulnerability (CVE-2026-123633)\n- Resolves: RHEL-309526 - nginx: NGINX ngx_http_v2_module\n  vulnerability (CVE-2026-123007)\n- Resolves: RHEL-309971 - nginx: nginx: Denial of Service via crafted TLS\n  connection (CVE-2026-118899)\n- Resolves: RHEL-309940 - nginx: NGINX use-after-free in worker process.\n  in the mail proxy server (CVE-2026-113425)\n- Resolves: RHEL-309730 - nginx: NGINX use-after-free condition in the\n  resolver (CVE-2026-123634)\n\n[2:1.20.1-32.1]\n- Resolves: RHEL-285368 - nginx: NGINX ngx_http_core_module\n  vulnerability (CVE-2026-97205)\n- Resolves: RHEL-284898 - nginx: nginx: heap-based buffer overflow in\n  ngx_http_core_module via alias with rewrite referencing\n   (CVE-2026-15176)",
